<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#b">Die</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb n="115" facs="#f0131"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Gedanken u&#x0364;ber die Wunder GOttes.</fw><lb/>
<div n="1"><head><hi rendition="#b">Die<lb/>
wunderbahre Vor&#x017F;orge GOttes<lb/>
u&#x0364;ber das Leben der Men&#x017F;chen.<lb/>
