<fw type="sig" place="bottom">H 2</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Toh-</fw><lb/>
<pb n="116" facs="#f0132"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Gedanken u&#x0364;ber die Wunder GOttes</fw><lb/>
<lg n="7"><l><hi rendition="#in">T</hi>ohren <note place="foot" n="(*)">Die Epicurer.</note> die ihr mir wolt &#x017F;agen,<lb/>
