<fw type="sig" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#fr">Er&#x017F;ter Theil.</hi> O</fw><fw type="catch" place="bottom">Was</fw><lb/>
<pb n="210" facs="#f0226"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">Das Lob der Gottheit ange&#x017F;timmet</fw><lb/>
